// Article 3. Incapacity and who the trustee is.
#require "1-creation.charter".
Fact physician
Fact certified Identified by physician
Act certify-incapacity Actor physician
  Holds when True
  Creates certified(physician)
Bool incapacitated
  Holds when Count(certified) >= 2

Var successor Identified by person = Daniel
Fact trustee Identified by person
  Default settlor-is-trustee Holds when settlor(person)
  Exception settlor-cannot-act Overrides settlor-is-trustee
    Rejects when settlor(person) && (incapacitated || deceased(Margaret))
  Default successor-steps-in
    Holds when successor(person) && (incapacitated || deceased(Margaret))

Clause 3.1 => certify-incapacity, certified, incapacitated
Clause 3.2 Definition => successor, settlor-is-trustee, settlor-cannot-act, successor-steps-in, trustee.
